---
const { num, reports, broken } = Astro.props;
---

<p class="lede">
  No member spent more than a published limit in any category, in any year from
  2020-21 to 2025-26. The check covered every category that has a limit in the{" "}
  {num(reports)} annual detail reports that load; {num(broken)} reports linked
  from the House of Assembly site are broken and could not be checked.
</p>
